{"id":"diez","lemma":"diez","pos":"noun","rank":406,"glosses":["A (highest grade in testing)"],"ipa":"/ˈdjeθ/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dieces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-diez.wav","examples":[{"text":"Te debo diez dólares.","en":"I owe you ten dollars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453445","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},null,{"g":"dollar","l":"dólar"}]},{"text":"¿Son cerca de las diez?","en":"Is it about ten o'clock?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538108","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null,{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"close to"]]},{"text":"Me quedaré aquí hasta las diez.","en":"I'll stay here until ten.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/90964","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be , to end up","l":"quedar"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"until"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Abre tu libro en la página diez.","en":"Open your book to page ten.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537976","words":[{"g":"to open, open up","l":"abrir"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"page"},null]},{"text":"Estaré con vosotros en diez minutos.","en":"I'll be with you in ten minutes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645661","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"you all"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"minute","l":"minuto"}]}]}